@host = http://localhost:5080
@key = dev-secret-key-change-me

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/users
X-API-KEY: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ada Lovelace", "email": "ada@example.com", "age": 36, "phoneNumber": "+971 50 123 4567", "role": 2 }

### List (search + paging)
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=10&search=ada
X-API-KEY: {{key}}

### Get by id (replace the guid)
GET {{host}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-API-KEY: {{key}}

### Update
PUT {{host}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-API-KEY: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ada King", "email": "ada@example.com", "age": 37, "role": 1 }

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-API-KEY: {{key}}

### Missing key -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/users
